This is the CAPS8 operating system for casette TU60 tape drive.
The caps.zip file is the source files. caps8_assembled.zip is a zip of
the CAPS8 subdirectory which has the source files assembled with the 
binaries needed to build a system. 
caps8_all.zip is all the files.

CAPS8/Binaries for Util has the binaries modifed with an extra field load
code at the beginning since util was loosing the first field load when
loading the files.

For instructions on building and using see
http://www.bitsavers.org/pdf/dec/pdp8/pdp8e/DEC-8E-OCASA-B-D_CAPS8_UG.pdf

The file caps8.tu60 is a bootable image for SIMH
The file caps8.tu6 is a bootable image for WinEight
